to handler methods. 
• @GetMapping: Shortcut for @RequestMapping(method = RequestMethod.GET). 
• @PostMapping: Shortcut for @RequestMapping(method = 
RequestMethod.POST). 
These specific annotations are used to simplify code and make it more readable. 
